urls": ["http://youtube.com/user/onedirectionvevo", "http://facebook.com/onedirectionmusic", "http://twitter.com/onedirction", "http://www.songkick.com/artists/3732956-one-direction", "http://www.onedirectionmusic.com/", "http://firefox.com"], "emails": [], "city": "London", "country": "United Kingdom", "genre": "", "elapsed_ms": 2289, "aggregator_expanded": 0, "bio_text": "", "sounds_like": "", "latest_track_title": "", "latest_track_release_date": "", "latest_track_precision": "", "latest_track_genre": "", "latest_track_tags": []}}, "raye": {"ts": 1763029603.8366988, "etag": "", "last_modified": "", "data": {"handle": "raye", "display_name": "RAYE", "external_urls": ["http://firefox.com"], "emails": [], "city": "South London", "country": "", "genre": "", "elapsed_ms": 2307, "aggregator_expanded": 0, "bio_text": "DEBUT ALBUM 'MY 21ST CENTURY BLUES' OUT NOW\n\nContact - pk@s1bling.com\n\nBritish singer-songwriter RAYE shines as one of the brightest stars in music today, boasting eight Top 20 UK singles, 5 Billion global streams, an Ivor Novello Award, and a track record of writing for the industry\u2019s biggest names. Since her debut in 2014, RAYE has undergone a remarkable journey to stardom. Nominated for a record-breaking seven 2024 BRIT Awards \u2013 the most of any artist in one year \u2013 her long-awaited independent debut album \u201cMy 21st Century Blues\u201d made an immediate impact. As a welcome result of her self-fulfilling work, RAYE unknowingly created the song that became synonymous with 2023. The global smash \u201cEscapism.\u201d not only became the largest selling single by a female British artist in 2023, but it also earned RAYE her first UK #1 and entry on the Billboard Hot 100 chart in the US where it\u2019s since been certified Platinum. Following support tours with Lewis Capaldi, Kali Uchis, and SZA, RAYE performed 130 headline shows including a rousing set at Glastonbury\u2019s Pyramid Stage. Her career-defining turn at Royal Albert Hall \u2013 accompanied by a 50-person orchestra and gospel choir \u2013 received a televised BBC special for the ages with critics heralding RAYE as \u201cthe most talented artist since Adele and Amy Winehouse\u201d (The Telegraph). This year, she performs her \u201cMy 21st Century Symphony\u201d to a sold-out crowd of 20,000 at The O2 Arena prior to making her debut at Coachella. After playing and owning the pop game, RAYE bet on herself and won.", "sounds_like": "", "latest_track_title": "WHERE IS MY HUSBAND!", "latest_track_release_date": "2025-09-19", "latest_track_precision": "day", "latest_track_genre": "Pop", "latest_track_tags": []}}, "paranoid-london": {"ts": 1763029603.94382, "etag": "", "last_modified": "", "data": {"handle": "paranoid-london", "display_name": "Paranoid London", "external_urls": ["http://firefox.com"], "emails": [], "city": "London", "country": "", "genre": "", "elapsed_ms": 2416, "aggregator_expanded": 0, "bio_text": "For bookings please contact\nUK/Europe/ROW - mike.robinson@arcade-talent.com\nUSA - alo@prismaartists.com\n\nAll licensing and remix enquiries info@paranoidlondon.com", "sounds_like": "", "latest_track_title": "", "latest_track_release_date": "", "latest_track_precision": "", "latest_track_genre": "", "latest_track_tags": []}}, "jamie-jones": {"ts": 1763029603.995897, "etag": "", "last_modified": "", "data": {"handle": "jamie-jones", "display_name": "Jamie Jones", "external_urls": ["https://www.facebook.com/jamiejonesmusic/", "https://www.bandsintown.com/a/89795-jamie-jones", "https://open.spotify.com/user/jamiejonesmusic?si=sNNU6uEKRYWoFXzAtV3OMA", "https://www.instagram.com/jamiejonesmusic/", "https://twitter.com/JamieJonesMusic", "https://www.youtube.com/c/JamieJonesOfficial", "http://firefox.com", "http://paradise.live/", "http://jamiejones.com/", "http://hotcreations.com/", "https://www.tiktok.com/@jamiejonesmusic"], "emails": [], "city": "London", "country": "", "genre": "", "elapsed_ms": 2467, "aggregator_expanded": 0, "bio_text": "A globally respected and highly accomplished artist, label boss at the seminal Hot Creations, founder and curator of the worldwide Paradise event series and member of cross-genre band Hot Natured, Jamie Jones has achieved iconic status in the electronic music world. A trendsetter and seasoned tastemaker, the Welsh dance music superstar pioneered his own distinct sound, drawing on his deep knowledge and experience to cultivate DJ sets that weave through a range of diverse, complementary styles selected to energise and enchant the dance floor.", "sounds_like": "", "latest_track_title": "Hot Robot Radio 214", "latest_track_release_date": "2025-11-12", "latest_track_precision": "day", "latest_track_genre": "Electronic", "latest_track_tags": []}}, "yukkayo1": {"ts": 1763029604.1182442, "etag": "", "last_modified": "", "data": {"handle": "yukkayo1", "display_name": "yukkayo", "external_urls": ["https://t.me/yukkayo", "http://firefox.com", "https://www.tiktok.com/@yukkayobeats", "https://t.me/yukkayobeats"], "emails": [], "city": "London", "country": "United Kingdom", "genre": "", "elapsed_ms": 2590, "aggregator_expanded": 0, "bio_text": "22 y.o", "sounds_like": "", "latest_track_title": "\u0441\u0430\u043c\u044b\u0438\u0306 \u0434\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0433\u043e\u0438\u0306 \u0447\u0435\u043b\u043e\u0432\u0435\u043a", "latest_track_release_date": "2025-10-31", "latest_track_precision": "day", "latest_track_genre": "Alternative Rock", "latest_track_tags": ["mylancore metalcore remix \"Alternative Rock\" yukkayo hoodtrap"]}}, "argyofficial": {"ts": 1763029604.3634791, "etag": "", "last_modified": "", "data": {"handle": "argyofficial", "display_name": "Argy", "external_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/@ArgyMusic", "https://www.beatport.com/artist/argy/8642", "https://www.instagram.com/argy", "https://music.amazon.es/artists/B008LSUX50/argy", "https://music.apple.com/us/artist/argy/67916691", "https://open.spotify.com/artist/1NaQOKgddaJipUtmptb7GI", "https://www.deeze