potify.com/artist/6UdQkz07ovbUYhACTLoXor", "https://music.apple.com/de/artist/unseen/1500164227?l=en"], "emails": [], "city": "Germany", "country": "", "genre": "", "elapsed_ms": 2318, "aggregator_expanded": 0, "bio_text": "Founder of @lelantusrecords\nFollow my Spotify playlist\nhttps://open.spotify.com/playlist/1bLfyXn9M5pLUeVSuShxxd\n\nAdrian Barrin, also known as Unseen., is a visionary artist who emerged onto the Melodic House & Techno scene in 2018. With a keen focus on blending melodic elements and emotional depth, Unseen. has established himself as a trailblazer in the industry.\n\nUnseen.'s musical productions are characterized by their captivating melodies and profound resonance, which not only make them unforgettable but also contribute to their resounding success. With each release, Unseen. demonstrates his ability to create music that deeply resonates with listeners, transcending boundaries and genres.\n\nWhile Adrian has already achieved considerable acclaim, he continues to push the boundaries of his artistry. His unwavering dedication and passion for his craft promise even greater things to come. To stay connected with Unseen.'s artistic journey and be a part of his future endeavors, make sure to follow him on all social media platforms.\n\nPrepare to embark on a musical odyssey with Unseen., as he unveils his innovative soundscape and takes the Melodic House & Techno industry to new heights.\n\nBookings & General Inquiries \u2b07\ufe0f\nunseendjs@gmail.com", "sounds_like": "", "latest_track_title": "", "latest_track_release_date": "", "latest_track_precision": "", "latest_track_genre": "", "latest_track_tags": []}}, "mashupgermany2018": {"ts": 1763094489.14308, "etag": "", "last_modified": "", "data": {"handle": "mashupgermany2018", "display_name": "Ben Stilller", "external_urls": ["http://firefox.com"], "emails": [], "city": "", "country": "", "genre": "", "elapsed_ms": 2342, "aggregator_expanded": 0, "bio_text": "http://www.mashup-germany.com", "s